+|---|---|
+| Condition store: 10k PBs, coalescing/shared owner, confirmed/live separation, failed writes/retry, last-owner cleanup, restart, corrupt-primary recovery | 31/31 headless, 31/31 Compatibility, 31/31 desktop Mobile |
